{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act3d0_level_act3d0_06_beg",
  "groupId": "act3d0",
  "stageId": "a003_06",
  "title": "杀手女皇",
  "storyCode": "OF-6",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "9dab0ba31639c9a542c17778a47f2f2d5c3199eaf4490a66f6e5da4422640043",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "大家！！准备好了吧！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "黑曜石节最盛大的联合LIVE将在3小时后开始！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "观众",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哦哦哦哦哦哦！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "时间差不多了。只要黑能和罗德岛相互牵制，这里也就一切顺利了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "让罗德岛和黑对立果然是步好棋，哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "快点！把这些东西给我搬走！动作不够快的话，你们的薪水也要打水漂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯？外面什么声音？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "博士，如果单纯的只是冲进广播塔，肯定会遭到克洛宁的埋伏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "如果你们和我一起行动，黑一定会先想办法解除各位的武装，那样我就更没有办法牵制她了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "就算粗暴地夺得了广播塔的控制权，如果没有政府的支持，我的话只会让市民陷入迷惑和恐慌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "如果黑保护着克洛宁，这对于各位的行动来说，也是很大的阻碍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "重要的是，克洛宁到底隐藏着什么，这可能需要各位去发掘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "也许克洛宁真的是个像纸面一样清白的人——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "那我们就会挟持他，逼他发出官方公告？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "对。如果真的是这样的话，我也不会介意去这么做，毕竟我确实是这么想的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "锡兰小姐，你很有胆识，但是甚至可以说有些冒险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "实验的数据和调查报告，罗德岛的各位已经帮我证实了，如果不这么做，汐斯塔的所有人都会遭殃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "我并不是要指责你什么，小姐。只是罗德岛的参与与否，并非由我决定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "你是指......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "博士。前因后果你都已经很清楚了。我们该怎么做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "都到这一步了，必须做些什么！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "让无辜的人受难，这违背了罗德岛的信条。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "所以，责任由谁承担？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "只要没人发现，就没有人参与过！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "你啊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "锡兰小姐，事不宜迟，我们启程吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "博士......"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "做你该做的事吧。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "我知道了，就由我去牵制黑吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "而且，我也有不得不去做的事情，我必须知道答案......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "黑......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "为什么要疏远我？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑",
          "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑",
          "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "小姐是在维多利亚经受过良好教育的人。你应该去更好的地方，别和我们这样的人一起留在这个城市挣扎。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "......不对。这一点也不对。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "黑，你在我心里是什么样的人？我在你心里又是什么样？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑",
          "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "我不是小姐看到的那样。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "因为你杀过人？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑",
          "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "因为你杀过很多人？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑",
          "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "不，小姐。别再说了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "可能我们都弄错了，黑。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑",
          "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "小姐，我不想你知道这些！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "对不起。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑",
          "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "......小姐？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "我已经知道了。我知道了你的过去......哪怕只是一点。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "如果黑不愿意我知道，对不起，我是没法说“我不知道”的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑",
          "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "不，小姐！你根本不应该知道！你本应该......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "我应该什么？应该这样，应该那样，应该好好读书，应该跻身名流，什么呀！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "我可不是什么温室里的花，也不是什么不谙世事的大小姐了！我知道我有必须要做的事情！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "保护汐斯塔，既是父亲的事情，是你的事情，也是我的事情！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "你不想我卷入这种事情，是为了保护我吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑",
          "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "我不......我......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "你和爸爸都一样，你们觉得你们这样安排我会过得很好，但我不觉得！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "我不觉得危险有什么，我不觉得黑的过去有什么！也许真正在经历这些的时候，我也会哭，也会悲伤，也会觉得可怕......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "只是，只要黑说，“需要锡兰来帮助我”的话，我一定会来的！无论你说什么，我都会听的！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "如果是朋友的话，就应该是这样啊，一直都仅仅是单方面地付出的话，算什么朋友啊！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "所以，黑，现在可以来帮我吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "你已经问过我，为什么要这样做？我已经回答过了......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "所以，你可不可以也给我一个答案，黑？如果过去的都过去了，你可以再当一次我的朋友吗，就像小时候那样？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑",
          "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "小姐......对不起。我为过去我的言行向你道歉。我的所作所为让你误解了，这些都不该发生的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "啊......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑",
          "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "小姐，你是我的朋友，一直都是。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛宁的手下",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛宁的手下",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "什么，你们絮叨这么久，然后呢，结论呢？怎么回事？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑",
          "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "小姐，请说，你接下来的安排是什么？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "啊？我......嗯......我想通过官方途径发送真实的灾害报告。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "现在罗德岛应该在搜集克洛宁的罪证，很快就能把他踢出市政厅机关......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "但灾害报告发布以后，黑曜石节可能要取消，汐斯塔也必须迁移，我怕......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑",
          "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "没关系，小姐。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "是，是吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑",
          "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "如果小姐这么想的话，我支持小姐这么做。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "......黑......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑",
          "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "小姐，你需要我保护你吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "嗯，需要。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑",
          "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "那就请小姐躲好了。很快就会结束。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛宁的手下",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "黑，你在做什么？你是要背叛命令吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑",
          "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "命令？协助克洛宁？一层伪装而已。自始至终，我只接到过两个命令。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑",
          "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "第一，老爷要我彻查克洛宁的罪证，包括关于他暗中控制V3工业公司，私自开采黑曜石。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑",
          "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "现在一切都明晰了，没什么好说的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛宁的手下",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "快，快动手！快把她们两个都抓了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑",
          "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "第二个命令你们也已经听见了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑",
          "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "——小姐要我保护她。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
